 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 0.17,
   "t1": 2.8,
   "text": "What happens when the Moon outgrows the Sun?",
   "line": "ch5_hook"
  },
  {
   "t0": 2.982,
   "t1": 5.402,
   "text": "One hundred thousand kilometers.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.422,
   "t1": 8.912,
   "text": "The Moon is nearly four times wider than tonight.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 8.932,
   "t1": 11.024,
   "text": "The Sun and the Moon look about",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.044,
   "t1": 13.157,
   "text": "the same size from Earth today.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 13.177,
   "t1": 17.087,
   "text": "That is why a total solar eclipse is possible at all.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 17.107,
   "t1": 20.432,
   "text": "Today, a total solar eclipse happens somewhere",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.452,
   "t1": 23.142,
   "text": "on Earth about every year and a half.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 23.162,
   "t1": 26.922,
   "text": "So when they line up, its shadow on Earth is wider.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 26.942,
   "t1": 29.597,
   "text": "And eclipses would be far more common.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 29.617,
   "t1": 31.766,
   "text": "Not every month, though, because the",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.786,
   "t1": 34.197,
   "text": "Moon's orbit is tilted by a few degrees.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.217,
   "t1": 35.417,
   "text": "But often.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 35.437,
   "t1": 39.377,
   "text": "The sky goes dim, and the stars come out in the daytime.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 39.397,
   "t1": 42.317,
   "text": "The air cools, even if only a little.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 42.337,
   "t1": 44.995,
   "text": "A long dark noon, with a faint",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.015,
   "t1": 47.692,
   "text": "glow around a huge black disc.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 47.765,
   "t1": 49.9,
   "text": "Quick thing: if that made the sky",
   "line": "cta1_follow"
  },
  {
   "t0": 49.92,
   "t1": 52.075,
   "text": "feel bigger, tap like and follow.",
   "line": "cta1_follow"
  },
  {
   "t0": 52.165,
   "t1": 55.05,
   "text": "And then you look at the Moon again, and it has moved.",
   "line": "ch5_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 55.255,
   "t1": 55.88,
   "text": "Closer.",
   "line": "ch5_loop"
  },
  {
   "t0": 55.9,
   "t1": 56.87,
   "text": "Faster.",
   "line": "ch5_loop"
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.89,
   "t1": 59.31,
   "text": "And the ground under you is feeling it too.",
   "line": "ch5_loop"
  },
  {
   "t0": 59.461,
   "t1": 60.766,
   "text": "Part five of eight.",
   "line": "closer5"
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.786,
   "t1": 62.571,
   "text": "Full video on YouTube.",
   "line": "closer5"
  }
